This implementation uses Dijkstra's algorithm to find the shortest or any path between the start and goal points in the grid. It keeps track of the path it is exploring and stops once it finds the goal, whether it is the shortest path or not. The implemented unit-weight Dijkstra algorithm prioritizes the path that is closer to the goal point.

